# Spellskite's {U/P} and Phyrexian Unlife (CR 119.4, 107.4f; the Unlife ruling: at 0 or less life you can't pay any amount
# of life but 0). Bot1, at 1 life, has Unlife. Bot2 Bolts Bot1 to -2 (life loss: Bot1 had 1 life as it was dealt). With a
# second Bolt on the stack aimed at Bot1, Bot1 activates Spellskite: the {U/P} can't be paid with 2 life now (it is paid so
# at 20 in its own scenario; were it offered, it would be the first choice offered and Bot1 would go to -4), so it is paid
# with an Island's {U}, and the Bolt is dealt to Spellskite instead. Bot1 stays at -2 with no poison counters.

